# a crawl line is at most 300 lines: a large font with a drop shadow and an
# outline is trimmed, with the Toaster's message (System4.1.Book page 2, EBS)
SET_PAGE 2
GET_PAGE TYPE
EXPECT Crawl
LOADFONT Toaster:PSFonts/SoftMaker/Balloon-ExtraBold 290
PICK_LINE
SET_FONT Toaster:PSFonts/SoftMaker/Balloon-ExtraBold 290
SET_SHAD TYPE DROP
SET_SHAD SIZE 5
SET_BORD SIZE 3
GET_LINE TALL
EXPECT 300
RENDER build/test/crawltrim.png
